scs2fbx bundles third-party software.
This program embeds ConverterPIX (https://github.com/mwl4/ConverterPIX) by
Michal Lesniak, licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0.
An unmodified copy is bundled as vendor/converter_pix.exe, unpacked at runtime
and run as a separate process. Its licence text is in
vendor/ConverterPIX-LICENSE.txt and its complete source is available at the URL
above.

The 3nK deobfuscation table and algorithm are derived from SII_Decrypt
(https://github.com/TheLazyTomcat/SII_Decrypt) by Frantisek Milt, which
documents the format.
